      POISSON_SOLVER MULTIPOLE
    &END POISSON
    &XC
      &XC_FUNCTIONAL PBE
      &END XC_FUNCTIONAL
    &END XC
  &END DFT
  &PROPERTIES
    &BANDSTRUCTURE
      &GW
